{"step_index":192,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:36:30Z","thinking":"**Reviewing proved lemmas**\n\nSuccessfully proved and reviewed five lemmas within `test_card_bound.lean`. These lemmas, `ballWithin_subset_succ`, `ballWithin_subset_add`, `ballWithin_succ_eq_self_implies_add`, `ballWithin_succ_eq_self_implies_univ`, and `card_ballWithin_succ_of_ne_univ`, establish a basis for further proofs. Now, will add the remaining lemmas to the file.\n\n\n**Proving ballWithin_univ_or_card_ge**\n\nUsing induction on `k`, handling the base case by simplifying and the inductive step by case analysis on the induction hypothesis.  If `ballWithin G k v = Finset.univ`, then the result follows by applying the inclusion of `ballWithin` at a successor. Otherwise, use `card_ballWithin_succ_of_ne_univ` in the inductive step with the omega tactic.\n\n**Proving ballWithin_card_pred_eq_univ**\n\nNow tackling `ballWithin_card_pred_eq_univ`, by leveraging the previously established lemma, `ballWithin_univ_or_card_ge`. Consider the case where the cardinality bound is `Fintype.card V - 1`. Case analysis on the result of the `ballWithin_univ_or_card_ge` lemma. The goal is to show the ball is the entire universe, so handle cases for being the whole set or having a high enough card. If the `inr` case occurs, derive a contradiction, ultimately proving the `inl` case.\n\n\n**Confirming contradiction for the proof**\n\nThe previous argument constructs a strict subset of the universal set, applying `Finset.card_lt_card` to the subset relationship. This results in the fact that the cardinality is less than the cardinality of the universe. Inconsistent findings emerge as the initial condition leads to contradicting inequalities. The `omega` tactic is leveraged to attempt the proof. This leads to a contradiction between derived inequalities, making the proof bulletproof.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"cat << 'EOF' > /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/test_card_bound2.lean\\nimport Mathlib\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\n\\nopen SimpleGraph\\nopen GraphCalc\\n\\nlemma minUpTo_le {n : ℕ} {p : ℕ → Prop} [DecidablePred p] (k : ℕ) (hk : k ≤ n) (hp : p k) :\\n    minUpTo n p ≤ k := by\\n  unfold minUpTo\\n  have hmem : k ∈ (Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p := by\\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_range]\\n    exact ⟨Nat.lt_succ_of_le hk, hp⟩\\n  have hmin := Finset.min_le hmem\\n  generalize hmin_eq : ((Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p).min = m\\n  rw [hmin_eq] at hmin\\n  cases m with\\n  | top => contradiction\\n  | coe val =>\\n    simp only [WithTop.coe_le_coe] at hmin\\n    exact hmin\\n\\ntheorem radius_le_eccentricity {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) :\\n    GraphCalc.radius G ≤ GraphCalc.eccentricity G v := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.radius\\n  have hmem : GraphCalc.eccentricity G v ∈ Finset.image (GraphCalc.eccentricity G) Finset.univ := by\\n    apply Finset.mem_image_of_mem\\n    exact Finset.mem_univ v\\n  obtain ⟨b, hb⟩ := Finset.min_of_mem hmem\\n  rw [hb]\\n  have hle : (Finset.image (GraphCalc.eccentricity G) Finset.univ).min ≤ ↑(GraphCalc.eccentricity G v) :=\\n    Finset.min_le hmem\\n  rw [hb] at hle\\n  exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mp hle\\n\\nlemma ballWithin_subset_succ {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k : ℕ) (v : V) :\\n    ballWithin G k v ⊆ ballWithin G (k + 1) v := by\\n  intro x hx\\n  dsimp [ballWithin]\\n  exact Finset.mem_union_left _ hx\\n\\nlemma ballWithin_subset_add {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k m : ℕ) (v : V) :\\n    ballWithin G k v ⊆ ballWithin G (k + m) v := by\\n  induction m with\\n  | zero => exact Finset.Subset.refl _\\n  | succ m ih =>\\n    have h1 := ballWithin_subset_succ G (k + m) v\\n    exact Finset.Subset.trans ih h1\\n\\nlemma ballWithin_succ_eq_self_im\n<truncated 4521 bytes>","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Running command\"","toolSummary":"\"Write test_card_bound2.lean\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
